OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BSelby faces tough UK opener, with      
OL,5,BAllen set to feature                   
OL,6,GFour-time world champion Mark Selby    
OL,7,Gwill begin his defence of the UK       
OL,8,GChampionship title against Matt Selt   
OL,9,Gon Saturday at York Barbican.          
OL,11,FIt represents a tough opening match    
OL,12,Ffor Selby, with fellow Englishman Selt 
OL,13,Fhaving beaten world number 17 Jak      
OL,14,FJones, the highest-ranked player in    
OL,15,Fthe qualifiers, to reach the televised 
OL,16,Fstages.                                
OL,18,FMark Allen, who spoke of his mental    
OL,19,Fhealth struggles in an emotional       
OL,20,Finterview last month, is set to face   
OL,21,FYuan Sijun.                            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
