OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BLinfield travel to Ballymena in        
OL,5,BBetMcLean Cup                          
OL,6,GHolders Linfield will travel to        
OL,7,GBallymena United in the quarter-finals 
OL,8,Gof the BetMcLean Cup.                  
OL,10,FDavid Healy's side edged past H&W      
OL,11,FWelders on Tuesday thanks to Adam      
OL,12,FFrizzell's penalty and will again be   
OL,13,Ftasked with an away tie in the last    
OL,14,Feight against Oran Kearney's outfit    
OL,15,Fwho were 3-0 winners away to Moyola    
OL,16,FPark.                                  
OL,18,FWhoever comes through the all-         
OL,19,FPremiership tie will host either       
OL,20,FQueen's University or 2025 winners     
OL,21,FCliftonville, with the semi-final draw 
OL,22,Falso made.                        G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
