OL,4,BFarrell picks side to 'back up' South  
OL,5,BAfrica win                             
OL,6,GIreland head coach Andy Farrell        
OL,7,Gbelieves the Nations Championship can  
OL,8,Gbe good preparation for next year's    
OL,9,GWorld Cup.                             
OL,11,FWith his side facing Australia in the  
OL,12,Ffifth-place play-off on Friday night   
OL,13,F(20:10 GMT), Farrell has made just two 
OL,14,Fchanges to the starting team that beat 
OL,15,FSouth Africa last weekend with the     
OL,16,Finjured Mack Hansen and banned Dan     
OL,17,FSheehan missing out.                   
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
